    {"id": "E-300713-a01", "request_id": "req-0713-1800", "speaker": "u1", "nature": "user_verbatim", "native_ref": "fixture:msg-1", "channel": "conversation",
     "received_at": "2030-07-13T18:00:00+02:00",
     "text": "这趟想省点钱，能走路就走路。我们的票是 ÖBB 的，WB 开头的车不能坐。别给我列一大串班次，给链接就行。14 号上午想看美术馆。谁的事谁做，别把别人的任务排给我。"},
    {"id": "E-300714-b02", "request_id": "req-0714-2015", "speaker": "u1", "nature": "user_verbatim", "native_ref": "fixture:msg-2", "channel": "conversation",
     "received_at": "2030-07-14T20:15:00+02:00",
     "text": "15 号晚上 19:30 在 Gasthaus Lindengrund 吃饭，就定这家，别换。晚饭后想去河边走走。"},
    {"id": "E-300715-c03", "request_id": "req-0715-0910", "speaker": "u1", "nature": "user_verbatim", "native_ref": "fixture:msg-3", "channel": "conversation",
     "received_at": "2030-07-15T09:10:00+02:00",
     "text": "我有点累，今天想轻松一点。"},
    {"id": "E-300715-d04", "request_id": "req-0715-1300", "speaker": "u1", "nature": "user_verbatim", "native_ref": "fixture:msg-4", "channel": "conversation",
     "received_at": "2030-07-15T13:00:12+02:00",
     "text": "今天我一个人，没有箱子，Teo 带着箱子先回 Grauwald 了，他想在那边逛书店。现在在 Altmoor 车站，下午想去两个湖边走走，怎么走？"},
    {"id": "E-300715-e05", "request_id": "req-0715-1308", "speaker": "u1", "nature": "user_verbatim", "native_ref": "fixture:msg-5", "channel": "conversation",
     "received_at": "2030-07-15T13:08:40+02:00",
     "text": "我膝盖有点疼。"},
    {"id": "E-300715-f06", "request_id": "req-0715-1316", "speaker": "u1", "nature": "user_verbatim", "native_ref": "fixture:msg-6", "channel": "conversation",
     "received_at": "2030-07-15T13:16:05+02:00",
     "text": "我先去车站旁边的面包店买点吃的，来得及吗？"},
    {"id": "E-300715-g07", "request_id": "req-0715-1352", "speaker": "u1", "nature": "user_verbatim", "native_ref": "fixture:msg-7", "channel": "conversation",
     "received_at": "2030-07-15T13:52:00+02:00",
     "text": "到北湖岸了，湖边步道口怎么走？"}
  ],
